  "goodToKnow": "Der Verkehrsunfall is a road accident. In Germany, after an accident you must secure the scene with das Warndreieck (warning triangle) and wear a warning vest, both compulsory in every car. Driving off is Unfallflucht, a crime. Call 110 for police and 112 for ambulance and fire. Compound: der Verkehr (traffic) + s + der Unfall (accident). Plural: die Verkehrsunfälle."
